Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 22:44:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add optional min/max clamp to scaling skill stats

- skill_stats gets nullable min_value/max_value columns
- Scaling formula becomes clamp(base + strength * scale, min, max) when set
- Editor lets you leave either bound blank for one-sided or unbounded stats, with validation that min cannot exceed max
- Calculator card shows a small (capped) label when the clamp is actively limiting the value
